sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Guest (Clerk)
  participant H as Home TestimonialCarousel
  participant M as FeedbackSubmitModal
  participant X as testimonials
  participant A as AdminTestimonialsPage

  H->>X: listPublished (accepted + staff)
  X-->>H: Carousel slides (fallback TESTIMONIALS if empty)
  G->>H: Share experience (FeedbackCtaStrip)
  alt Not signed in
    H->>G: Clerk openSignIn
  else Signed in
    G->>M: Rating title body optional photo
    M->>X: submit + storage upload URL
    X->>X: Insert status pending
  end
  A->>X: listForAdmin (adminToken)
  A->>X: accept
  X->>X: status accepted
  H->>X: listPublished
  X-->>H: New slide on carousel
